# Example crontab for Smogon Go population scripts
# Run `crontab -e` and paste these lines to automate fetching new stats

# Check for new Smogon stats every hour (at the top of the hour)
# This script pings smogon.com/stats and compares it to the running proxy-api.
# If a new month is found, it automatically compiles and runs the population scripts,
# invalidates the cache, and triggers a frontend SSG rebuild on Cloudflare.
0 * * * * /home/ubuntu/proxy-api/check-new-month.sh >> /home/ubuntu/proxy-api/logs/check-new-month.log 2>&1
